# Baseline screenshots for visual regression testing
#
# This directory stores baseline PNG images captured with /ios.snapshot.
# These are used by /ios.diff to detect visual regressions.
#
# To create a baseline:
#   /ios.snapshot --save-baseline login
#
# To compare against baseline:
#   /ios.diff login
#
# Naming convention:
#   {screen_name}.png           - Default device
#   {screen_name}@iPhone15.png  - Device-specific baseline
#   {screen_name}@dark.png      - Dark mode variant
